(580306, -1, 8, -379, 64, 0, 'Path to Ascension Wildcard: Basics', '- Begin rolling spells and talents starting at level 10.  - Roll new spells every 2 levels and talents every level.', 'Roll random spells and talents as you level up. Wildcard Heroes roll a new spell every 2 levels and a new talent every level.', 'Return to the Call Board.', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(580307, -1, 8, -379, 64, 0, 'Path to Ascension Wildcard: Scroll of Fortune', '- Visit Silas Darkmoon in your Capital City every 10 levels to receive Scrolls of Fortune.', 'Use Scrolls of Fortune to reroll spells and talents at various levels. Get more Scrolls of Fortune from Silas as you level up.', 'Return to the Call Board.', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(580308, -1, 8, -379, 64, 0, 'Path to Ascension Wildcard: Scroll Buy Back', '- After reaching max level, buy back any unspent Scrolls of Fortune by visiting Silas Darkmoon.', 'Purchase Scrolls of Fortune you have previously earned but not used. This option is available each time you prestige.', 'Return to the Call Board.', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(580309, -1, 8, -379, 64, 0, 'Path to Ascension Wildcard: Prestige', '- Talk to Chromie to prestige your character and reset to level 1.', 'Prestiging resets your character’s level but retains progress. Unlock powerful rewards and try new builds each time you prestige.', 'Return to the Call Board.', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(580310, -1, 8, -379, 64, 0, 'Path to Ascension Wildcard: Rapid Rerolling', '- Open Character Advancement at max level to enable Rapid Rerolling mode.', 'Use Rapid Rerolling to quickly cycle through Scrolls of Fortune and find the spells and talents that best suit your build.', 'Return to the Call Board.', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(580311, -1, 8, -379, 64, 0, 'Path to Ascension Wildcard: Rapid Reroll Full Builds', '- Open the Hero Architect and select a Featured Build to use in Rapid Rerolling.', 'Use the Hero Architect to import Featured Builds into Rapid Rerolling mode. Featured Builds are optimized for rapid progression.', 'Return to the Call Board.', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(1903512, -1, 8, -379, 0, 0, 'Path to Ascension: Collection and Capitals', 'Open Character Advancement then click the Vanity tab.\nSearch for Scroll of Retreat or Filter by Known, click the scroll and hit Deliver Item!', 'Open Character Advancement then click the Vanity tab.\nSearch for Scroll of Retreat or Filter by Known, click the scroll and hit Deliver Item!', 'Collect the reward in Path to Ascension.', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(1903513, -1, 15, -379, 64, 0, 'Path to Ascension: Activating Mystic Scrolls', '- Obtain a Mystic Enchanting Scroll by defeating enemies or trading other players.  - Interact with a Mystic Enchanting Altar found in your Capital City or in the World and select Enchant Scrolls tab.  - Activate a Mystic Scroll and apply it to an Active Enchant slot.', 'Mystic Enchanting Scrolls can be obtained by defeating enemies, found hidden throughout the world, or by trading other players.    Once obtained, visit a Mystic Enchanting Altar to apply a Mystic Scroll to gain its powers! Mystic Enchanting Altars can often be found summoned in Capital Cities, or you can venture into the world to visit one. Their locations are marked on the world map.    Mystic Enchants are key to unlocking your power as a Hero. Find Mystic Enchants that empower your spells or unlock whole new archetypes to increase your power.', 'Return to the Call Board.', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(1903520, -1, 8, -379, 0, 0, 'Path to Ascension: Rank Up Your Spells', 'Talk to the Beginner''s Book of Ascension.\nSelect Train Me and rank up your spells.', 'Talk to the Beginner''s Book of Ascension.\nSelect Train Me and rank up your spells.', 'Collect the reward in Path to Ascension.', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(1903521, -1, 8, -379, 0, 0, 'Path to Ascension: Capital of the Horde!', 'Speak to High Overlord Saurfang in Orgrimmar.', 'Speak to High Overlord Saurfang in Orgrimmar.', 'Collect the reward in Path to Ascension.', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(1903522, -1, 8, -379, 0, 0, 'Path to Ascension: Capital of the Alliance!', 'Speak to Stephanie Turner in Stormwind.', 'Speak to Stephanie Turner in Stormwind.', 'Collect the reward in Path to Ascension.', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(1903539, -1, 10, -379, 64, 0, 'Path to Ascension: Building Your Class Fantasy', 'Choose a featured level build in the Hero Architect or build your own.', 'Hit N, or click the scroll icon by your mini map to open up the Character Advancement Menu.  Click the Hero Architect tab near the bottom left of the menu.  Scroll through the various builds in the list to the right to find one that interests you or fits your class fantasy. You can change your build anytime, so have fun and pick something that stands out to you. If the build does not match your playstyle you can always repick.  Find a build you would like to play and select "Choose This Build" to activate it. You will immediately learn all the required spells and talents, and will automatically learn spells and talents as you level!  If you are experienced with Ascension, or would like to craft your build from scratch, you can select "No, I''d like to pick abilities and talents myself."', 'Return to the Beginner''s Book of Ascension or the Callboard to turn in this quest. You can use the Architect to pick a new build at anytime!', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(1903540, -1, 8, -379, 0, 0, 'Path to Ascension: Visit an Innkeeper', 'Visit the nearest innkeeper to set your hearthstone.', 'Visit the nearest innkeeper to set your hearthstone.', 'Collect the reward in Path to Ascension.', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
